bin/
*.o
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# data/*.pdb WAS ignored here, on the grounds that those structures are copies of
# us_somo/somo/demo/*.pdb. They are now tracked instead: the two sets serve different purposes
# and are free to diverge -- the demo structures exist for the demos, while these are the
# perceiver's regression fixtures, and the calibrated score must not move because someone
# edited a demo. They happen to be byte-identical today; that is not a guarantee.
# reference tables are read directly from us_somo/etc (no copies, so they cannot drift)
